 * (allocator/log/encode/pool/memory/constants/helpers, etc.). Per cjpm's
 * directory scanning rules, the parent directory must contain at least one .cj
 * file or the subdirectories won't be scanned as sources, so this anchor file
 * is kept.
 *
 * @intro[zh-cn] three.utils 提供通用工具与辅助能力，成员已按功能拆分至子包：
